{"event":"step_update","step_update":{"conversation_id":"aedff576-8f09-4cb7-9a33-42a10e2bfcbd","step_index":450,"state":"DONE","step_type":"tool","tool_name":"call_mcp_tool","duration_seconds":0.3117995,"tool_info":{"name":"call_mcp_tool","parameters":{"Arguments":{"action":"read","key":"c67","length":1500,"offset":1500},"ServerName":"project_architect","ToolName":"planning_context"},"output":"{\"contextSha256\":\"bada1daa10ed0922c3067609d9df608ba6b131aa7fcbacf993d3562263cc2932\",\"key\":\"c67\",\"path\":\"/blueprint/blocks/13\",\"encoding\":\"json\",\"sha256\":\"7d33b4b604fe281f75e03d8676f3d90a1039bf1e615b4680e35c9df23ecbdfcd\",\"content\":\"使 schedulerEpoch 失效，创建全新 input 节点替换旧节点（oldNode.replaceWith(newNode)），在新节点闭包中初始化 bornGeneration 与全新 isComposing，清空展示区为占位符并回焦新节点；\\\\n  * 旧节点的任何迟到 compositionend、beforeinput 或尾随 input 事件只能到达旧节点绑定的闭包函数，由于 node !== activeInputNode 且 bornGeneration !== inputGeneration 被第一道前置守卫直接丢弃返回，绝不接触 activeInputNode，绝不制造空值错误，也无需额外按键解锁；\\\\n  * 新节点的物理键入、粘贴或新发起的中文拼音输入均直接在新闭包与新代际中正常流转 300ms 防抖。\\\\n- 空值与纯空格输入彻底清除旧结果：当用户手动将输入文本全部删空或输入纯空白字符（空格、制表符）且停止 300ms 时，防抖回调针对快照判定校验失败，展示区已显示的旧项目名立即被清除并恢复为初始灰色占位文字“【等待输入核对】”，在输入框正下方就地显示红色警示“项目名不能为空，请输入有效字符”；输入框内的既有字符（包括空格）原样完好保留。\\\\n- 待验证状态与环境差异说明：桌面端 Chrome、Edge、Firefox 与 Safari 在原生 IME 输入下替换 DOM 节点的具体事件派发与会话生命周期行为属于开发阶段真机实测用例，不作彻底杜绝所有原生竞态的无证据绝对承诺。\\\",\\\"dependsOn\\\":[\\\"blk-prod-scope\\\"],\\\"evidenceIds\\\":[\\\"evidence-1e3fc8ef-8a1e-404f-a931-72f46fd0d8ed\\\",\\\"evidence-6f045d0d-928d-4f66-8427-b7f62c91ae8a\\\",\\\"evidence-15da1e6d-9c13-49f1-a146-f94eb1d8e564\\\",\\\"evidence-27ebc57b-491d-46f1-bdb3-33df17720f9f\\\",\\\"evidence-dab40954-74e0-4d24-bb31-1064f5dd626f\\\",\\\"evidence-7cca7dfc-39e6-47cf-8cc6-3f7ccb9f622e\\\",\\\"evidence-dea1091c-52e5-4841-bdfe-a040b152fc88\\\",\\\"evidence-7ec331d7-1d2e-415d-abc5-fecbed731559\\\",\\\"evidence-mdn-ime-compositionstart-session\\\",\\\"evidence-e925f9c6-bafa-4a0e-bc35-de2a031a6cc9\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"blk-feat-input-display\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"feature\\\",\\\"requirementIds\\\":[\\\"blk-prod-scope\\\",\\\"blk-prod-outcomes\\\"],\\\"stage\\\":\\\"product\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"功能特性：输入 300ms 防抖实时反馈、节点代际闭包隔离与草稿快照契约\\\",\\\"approvedBy\\\":\\\"api-automated-acceptance-flash-materials-final-20261004-01-feedback-1791157795159\\\",\\\"approvedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T23:49:55.209Z\\\"}\",\"offset\":1500,\"nextOffset\":null,\"totalCharacters\":2991}"}}}
